From 03c2c230b126ecff6595181cf09481c96450058d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craig Shaw <craig@craigshaw.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:19:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Resume selected timed blocks through the owning scheduler

Keep exact internal continuation entries separate from architectural subroutine dispatch. Require balanced block entries and local IR values, then return through real guest frames and the scheduler unwind path. Add event, repeat-resume, width, return and cache checks.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
